Description: Let a template range say what kind of template block it is
 A TemplateInfo object may now carry the block's kind (print, tag or
 comment). The tokenizer already keeps the info object on each template
 character, so the handlers can read it through templateKindOf and
 isStructuralTemplate. Templates without a kind behave as before.
Author: Numiko
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Test: npm run test:upstream; used by EHP-04 and EHP-05
Last-Update: 2026-10-22
